  "ruleText": "Vet 104.02 Fees. The office of professional licensure and certification shall charge the fees listed in Plc 1001.05 for the copying of documents.\n\nSource. #6480, eff 3-29-97; ss by #7417, eff 12-21-00; ss by #9386, eff 2-11-09; ss by #13269, eff 9-29-21; ss by #14627, eff 7-1-26",
